#. type: Title #
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom hydrator type casters"
msgstr "Type casters personalizados para o hydrator"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "[Yii Hydrator](https://github.com/yiisoft/hydrator) creates objects and fills them with data from arrays. It's used directly and by packages built on top of it:"
msgstr "O [Yii Hydrator](https://github.com/yiisoft/hydrator) cria objetos e os preenche com dados de arrays. Ele é usado diretamente e por pacotes construídos sobre ele:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "[Yii Input HTTP](https://github.com/yiisoft/input-http) fills request input objects from query parameters, request body, and, with the help of [Yii Router](https://github.com/yiisoft/router), route arguments."
msgstr "O [Yii Input HTTP](https://github.com/yiisoft/input-http) preenche objetos de entrada da requisição a partir de parâmetros da query string, do corpo da requisição e, com a ajuda do [Yii Router](https://github.com/yiisoft/router), dos argumentos da rota."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "[Yii Form Model](https://github.com/yiisoft/form-model) provides `FormHydrator` that fills form models from submitted data."
msgstr "O [Yii Form Model](https://github.com/yiisoft/form-model) fornece o `FormHydrator`, que preenche form models com os dados enviados."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "The incoming data is usually \"raw\": HTTP requests, database rows, and queue messages contain strings, numbers, and arrays. Before assigning a value to a property or passing it to a constructor parameter, the hydrator converts it to the declared type. A *type caster* performs this conversion. By writing your own type caster, you teach the hydrator to create your types, such as value objects, from raw data."
msgstr "Os dados recebidos geralmente são \"brutos\": requisições HTTP, linhas do banco de dados e mensagens de fila contêm strings, números e arrays. Antes de atribuir um valor a uma propriedade ou passá-lo a um parâmetro do construtor, o hydrator o converte para o tipo declarado. Um *type caster* faz essa conversão. Ao escrever seu próprio type caster, você ensina o hydrator a criar seus tipos, como value objects, a partir de dados brutos."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why custom type casters"
msgstr "Por que type casters personalizados"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "Out of the box, the hydrator uses a composite type caster with two casters:"
msgstr "Por padrão, o hydrator usa um type caster composto com dois casters:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "`PhpNativeTypeCaster` casts values to built-in PHP types, such as `int`, `string`, `bool`, and `array`."
msgstr "`PhpNativeTypeCaster` converte valores para tipos nativos do PHP, como `int`, `string`, `bool` e `array`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "`HydratorTypeCaster` creates nested objects from arrays using the hydrator itself."
msgstr "`HydratorTypeCaster` cria objetos aninhados a partir de arrays usando o próprio hydrator."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "That's enough for DTOs with scalar properties, but not for a rich domain model. Consider a property typed as `UserId`, `Email`, or `Money`. The incoming value is a string, and neither of the default casters knows how to turn it into such an object. So you end up declaring the property as `string` and converting it by hand wherever it's used:"
msgstr "Isso basta para DTOs com propriedades escalares, mas não para um modelo de domínio rico. Considere uma propriedade tipada como `UserId`, `Email` ou `Money`. O valor recebido é uma string, e nenhum dos casters padrão sabe transformá-lo em um objeto desses. Assim, você acaba declarando a propriedade como `string` e convertendo-a manualmente onde quer que ela seja usada:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"final class CreatePostForm extends FormModel\n"
"{\n"
"    public string $authorId = '';\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// In every action that uses the form:\n"
"try {\n"
"    $authorId = new UserId($form->authorId);\n"
"} catch (InvalidArgumentException) {\n"
"    // Report the error somehow.\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"final class CreatePostForm extends FormModel\n"
"{\n"
"    public string $authorId = '';\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// Em toda action que usa o formulário:\n"
"try {\n"
"    $authorId = new UserId($form->authorId);\n"
"} catch (InvalidArgumentException) {\n"
"    // Reporte o erro de alguma forma.\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "With a type caster for `UserId`, you can declare the property with its real type. The conversion happens during hydration:"
msgstr "Com um type caster para `UserId`, você pode declarar a propriedade com seu tipo real. A conversão acontece durante a hidratação:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"final class CreatePostForm extends FormModel\n"
"{\n"
"    public ?UserId $authorId = null;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// $form->authorId is already an instance of UserId.\n"
msgstr ""
"final class CreatePostForm extends FormModel\n"
"{\n"
"    public ?UserId $authorId = null;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// $form->authorId já é uma instância de UserId.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "The conversion logic lives in a single place. Once you register the caster, the hydrator applies it to every property and constructor parameter of the matching type in every object it creates."
msgstr "A lógica de conversão fica em um único lugar. Depois que você registra o caster, o hydrator o aplica a todas as propriedades e parâmetros de construtor do tipo correspondente em todos os objetos que ele cria."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "Typical use cases are:"
msgstr "Casos de uso típicos:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "value objects, such as entity IDs, emails, phone numbers, and money amounts."
msgstr "value objects, como IDs de entidades, e-mails, números de telefone e valores monetários."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "types from third-party libraries, such as UUIDs, dates, or currencies."
msgstr "tipos de bibliotecas de terceiros, como UUIDs, datas ou moedas."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "consistent normalization of values, for example, parsing dates in a format specific to your application."
msgstr "normalização consistente de valores, por exemplo, interpretar datas em um formato específico da sua aplicação."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Anatomy of a type caster"
msgstr "Anatomia de um type caster"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "A type caster implements `Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\TypeCasterInterface` with a single method:"
msgstr "Um type caster implementa `Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\TypeCasterInterface`, que tem um único método:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "public function cast(mixed $value, TypeCastContext $context): Result;\n"
msgstr "public function cast(mixed $value, TypeCastContext $context): Result;\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "`$value` is the raw value to convert."
msgstr "`$value` é o valor bruto a ser convertido."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "`$context` is a `Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\TypeCastContext`. Its `getReflectionType()` method returns the declared type of the target property or constructor parameter. Use it to decide whether the caster supports the target type."
msgstr "`$context` é um `Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\TypeCastContext`. Seu método `getReflectionType()` retorna o tipo declarado da propriedade ou do parâmetro de construtor de destino. Use-o para decidir se o caster suporta o tipo de destino."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "The method returns a `Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\Result`: `Result::success($convertedValue)` if the conversion succeeded or `Result::fail()` if the caster can't handle the value."
msgstr "O método retorna um `Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\Result`: `Result::success($convertedValue)` se a conversão deu certo ou `Result::fail()` se o caster não consegue lidar com o valor."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "Follow these rules when writing a type caster:"
msgstr "Siga estas regras ao escrever um type caster:"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "**Check the target type first.** If the declared type isn't the one your caster is responsible for, return `Result::fail()` right away so other casters can handle the value."
msgstr "**Verifique o tipo de destino primeiro.** Se o tipo declarado não for aquele pelo qual seu caster é responsável, retorne `Result::fail()` imediatamente para que outros casters possam lidar com o valor."

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "**Handle both named and union types.** PHP represents a nullable type such as `?Email` (or `Email|null`) with `ReflectionNamedType` and `Email|string` with `ReflectionUnionType`. In the latter case, look for your type among its subtypes."
msgstr "**Trate tipos nomeados e tipos união.** O PHP representa um tipo anulável como `?Email` (ou `Email|null`) com `ReflectionNamedType` e `Email|string` com `ReflectionUnionType`. No segundo caso, procure seu tipo entre os subtipos."

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "**Don't handle `null` yourself.** If the value is `null`, just return `Result::fail()`. `PhpNativeTypeCaster` returns `null` for any type that allows it, so a `null` value assigned to `?Email` stays `null`."
msgstr "**Não trate `null` você mesmo.** Se o valor for `null`, apenas retorne `Result::fail()`. O `PhpNativeTypeCaster` retorna `null` para qualquer tipo que o permita, então um valor `null` atribuído a `?Email` continua `null`."

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "**Accept already converted values.** If the value is already an instance of the target type, return it as is."
msgstr "**Aceite valores já convertidos.** Se o valor já for uma instância do tipo de destino, retorne-o como está."

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "**Fail instead of throwing.** If your caster can't convert the value, for example, a malformed string, return `Result::fail()`. An exception would break the whole hydration."
msgstr "**Falhe em vez de lançar exceções.** Se seu caster não consegue converter o valor, por exemplo, uma string malformada, retorne `Result::fail()`. Uma exceção quebraria toda a hidratação."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "Keep in mind what happens when no caster succeeds:"
msgstr "Tenha em mente o que acontece quando nenhum caster tem sucesso:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "For a property, the cast fails silently. The hydrator doesn't set the property or report an error, so the property keeps its default value. Reporting the problem to the user is the job of the validation that runs after hydration.  See [Null and invalid values](#null-and-invalid-values) for an example."
msgstr "Para uma propriedade, a conversão falha silenciosamente. O hydrator não define a propriedade nem reporta um erro, então a propriedade mantém seu valor padrão. Reportar o problema ao usuário é papel da validação que roda após a hidratação.  Veja [Valores nulos e inválidos](#valores-nulos-e-invalidos) para um exemplo."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "For a constructor parameter, the hydrator omits the argument. If the parameter has a default value, it's used.  Otherwise, object creation fails with `WrongConstructorArgumentsCountException`, even for a nullable parameter without a default value."
msgstr "Para um parâmetro de construtor, o hydrator omite o argumento. Se o parâmetro tiver um valor padrão, ele é usado.  Caso contrário, a criação do objeto falha com `WrongConstructorArgumentsCountException`, mesmo para um parâmetro anulável sem valor padrão."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering a type caster"
msgstr "Registrando um type caster"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "Combine type casters with `CompositeTypeCaster`. It tries the casters one by one and uses the result of the first one that succeeds. To add your caster, redefine `TypeCasterInterface` in the DI container configuration, for example, in `config/common/di/hydrator.php`. The `HydratorInterface` implementation from the container uses this chain, as do packages that rely on it, such as Yii Input HTTP:"
msgstr "Combine type casters com `CompositeTypeCaster`. Ele tenta os casters um a um e usa o resultado do primeiro que tiver sucesso. Para adicionar seu caster, redefina `TypeCasterInterface` na configuração do container de DI, por exemplo, em `config/common/di/hydrator.php`. A implementação de `HydratorInterface` do container usa essa cadeia, assim como os pacotes que dependem dela, como o Yii Input HTTP:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Shared\\Uuid\\UuidValueTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\CompositeTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\HydratorTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\PhpNativeTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\TypeCasterInterface;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    TypeCasterInterface::class => static fn() => new CompositeTypeCaster(\n"
"        new UuidValueTypeCaster(),\n"
"        new PhpNativeTypeCaster(),\n"
"        new HydratorTypeCaster(),\n"
"    ),\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Shared\\Uuid\\UuidValueTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\CompositeTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\HydratorTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\PhpNativeTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\TypeCasterInterface;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    TypeCasterInterface::class => static fn() => new CompositeTypeCaster(\n"
"        new UuidValueTypeCaster(),\n"
"        new PhpNativeTypeCaster(),\n"
"        new HydratorTypeCaster(),\n"
"    ),\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "Since the first successful result wins, the order matters:"
msgstr "Como o primeiro resultado bem-sucedido vence, a ordem importa:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "Put custom casters before `PhpNativeTypeCaster`. Otherwise, for a property declared as `UserId|string`, `PhpNativeTypeCaster` accepts a string as is, and your caster never runs."
msgstr "Coloque os casters personalizados antes do `PhpNativeTypeCaster`. Caso contrário, para uma propriedade declarada como `UserId|string`, o `PhpNativeTypeCaster` aceita a string como está, e seu caster nunca é executado."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "Keep the default casters in the list. `PhpNativeTypeCaster` casts scalar values to built-in types, and `HydratorTypeCaster` creates nested objects from arrays."
msgstr "Mantenha os casters padrão na lista. O `PhpNativeTypeCaster` converte valores escalares para tipos nativos, e o `HydratorTypeCaster` cria objetos aninhados a partir de arrays."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "If a caster has dependencies, take it from the container:"
msgstr "Se um caster tiver dependências, obtenha-o do container:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Shared\\Money\\MoneyTypeCaster;\n"
"use Psr\\Container\\ContainerInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\CompositeTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\HydratorTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\PhpNativeTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\TypeCasterInterface;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    TypeCasterInterface::class => static fn(ContainerInterface $container) => new CompositeTypeCaster(\n"
"        $container->get(MoneyTypeCaster::class),\n"
"        new PhpNativeTypeCaster(),\n"
"        new HydratorTypeCaster(),\n"
"    ),\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Shared\\Money\\MoneyTypeCaster;\n"
"use Psr\\Container\\ContainerInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\CompositeTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\HydratorTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\PhpNativeTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\TypeCasterInterface;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    TypeCasterInterface::class => static fn(ContainerInterface $container) => new CompositeTypeCaster(\n"
"        $container->get(MoneyTypeCaster::class),\n"
"        new PhpNativeTypeCaster(),\n"
"        new HydratorTypeCaster(),\n"
"    ),\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering for form models"
msgstr "Registrando para form models"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "`FormHydrator` from Yii Form Model doesn't use `TypeCasterInterface`. Its DI configuration creates a dedicated hydrator with its own chain of type casters, so add your caster there as well:"
msgstr "O `FormHydrator` do Yii Form Model não usa `TypeCasterInterface`. Sua configuração de DI cria um hydrator dedicado com sua própria cadeia de type casters, então adicione seu caster lá também:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Shared\\Uuid\\UuidValueTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Definitions\\DynamicReference;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\FormModel\\FormHydrator;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\FormModel\\NonArrayTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\Hydrator;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\CompositeTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\HydratorTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\NullTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\PhpNativeTypeCaster;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    FormHydrator::class => [\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'hydrator' => DynamicReference::to([\n"
"                'class' => Hydrator::class,\n"
"                '__construct()' => [\n"
"                    'typeCaster' => new CompositeTypeCaster(\n"
"                        new NullTypeCaster(emptyString: true),\n"
"                        new UuidValueTypeCaster(),\n"
"                        new PhpNativeTypeCaster(),\n"
"                        new NonArrayTypeCaster(),\n"
"                        new HydratorTypeCaster(),\n"
"                    ),\n"
"                ],\n"
"            ]),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Shared\\Uuid\\UuidValueTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Definitions\\DynamicReference;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\FormModel\\FormHydrator;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\FormModel\\NonArrayTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\Hydrator;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\CompositeTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\HydratorTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\NullTypeCaster;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\PhpNativeTypeCaster;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    FormHydrator::class => [\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'hydrator' => DynamicReference::to([\n"
"                'class' => Hydrator::class,\n"
"                '__construct()' => [\n"
"                    'typeCaster' => new CompositeTypeCaster(\n"
"                        new NullTypeCaster(emptyString: true),\n"
"                        new UuidValueTypeCaster(),\n"
"                        new PhpNativeTypeCaster(),\n"
"                        new NonArrayTypeCaster(),\n"
"                        new HydratorTypeCaster(),\n"
"                    ),\n"
"                ],\n"
"            ]),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "This definition replaces the one from the package, so keep its type casters. This example uses the list from `config/di.php` of Yii Form Model 1.1. Check it against the version you use. `NullTypeCaster` turns empty strings submitted by forms into `null` for nullable properties, so it stays first."
msgstr "Essa definição substitui a do pacote, então mantenha os type casters dele. Este exemplo usa a lista do `config/di.php` do Yii Form Model 1.1. Confira com a versão que você usa. O `NullTypeCaster` transforma strings vazias enviadas por formulários em `null` para propriedades anuláveis, por isso ele continua em primeiro."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: UUID value objects"
msgstr "Exemplo: value objects de UUID"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "Entity IDs often use value objects, such as `UserId`, `PostId`, and `OrderId`, instead of plain strings.  Such objects make method signatures self-documenting and prevent passing a post ID where a method expects a user ID.  The following example shows how to write a type caster that creates them from UUID strings."
msgstr "IDs de entidades frequentemente usam value objects, como `UserId`, `PostId` e `OrderId`, em vez de strings simples.  Esses objetos tornam as assinaturas dos métodos autodocumentadas e impedem que você passe um ID de post onde um método espera um ID de usuário.  O exemplo a seguir mostra como escrever um type caster que os cria a partir de strings UUID."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Value objects"
msgstr "Value objects"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "All ID value objects extend an abstract `UuidValue` class. The example uses [ramsey/uuid](https://github.com/ramsey/uuid) to validate and generate UUIDs:"
msgstr "Todos os value objects de ID estendem uma classe abstrata `UuidValue`. O exemplo usa [ramsey/uuid](https://github.com/ramsey/uuid) para validar e gerar UUIDs:"

#. type: Fenced code block (shell)
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "composer require ramsey/uuid\n"
msgstr "composer require ramsey/uuid\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace App\\Shared\\Uuid;\n"
"\n"
"use InvalidArgumentException;\n"
"use Ramsey\\Uuid\\Uuid;\n"
"use Stringable;\n"
"\n"
"use function sprintf;\n"
"\n"
"abstract readonly class UuidValue implements Stringable\n"
"{\n"
"    private string $value;\n"
"\n"
"    final public function __construct(string $value)\n"
"    {\n"
"        if (!Uuid::isValid($value)) {\n"
"            throw new InvalidArgumentException(sprintf('\"%s\" is not a valid UUID.', $value));\n"
"        }\n"
"        $this->value = Uuid::fromString($value)->toString();\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public static function generate(): static\n"
"    {\n"
"        return new static(Uuid::uuid7()->toString());\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function equals(self $other): bool\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $other instanceof static && $other->value === $this->value;\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function __toString(): string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->value;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace App\\Shared\\Uuid;\n"
"\n"
"use InvalidArgumentException;\n"
"use Ramsey\\Uuid\\Uuid;\n"
"use Stringable;\n"
"\n"
"use function sprintf;\n"
"\n"
"abstract readonly class UuidValue implements Stringable\n"
"{\n"
"    private string $value;\n"
"\n"
"    final public function __construct(string $value)\n"
"    {\n"
"        if (!Uuid::isValid($value)) {\n"
"            throw new InvalidArgumentException(sprintf('\"%s\" is not a valid UUID.', $value));\n"
"        }\n"
"        $this->value = Uuid::fromString($value)->toString();\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public static function generate(): static\n"
"    {\n"
"        return new static(Uuid::uuid7()->toString());\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function equals(self $other): bool\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $other instanceof static && $other->value === $this->value;\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function __toString(): string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->value;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "The constructor is final, so `new static()` is safe and creates every child class from a string the same way.  A concrete ID is just an empty child class:"
msgstr "O construtor é final, então `new static()` é seguro e cria todas as classes filhas a partir de uma string da mesma forma.  Um ID concreto é apenas uma classe filha vazia:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace App\\User;\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Shared\\Uuid\\UuidValue;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class UserId extends UuidValue\n"
"{\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace App\\User;\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Shared\\Uuid\\UuidValue;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class UserId extends UuidValue\n"
"{\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "Define `PostId` and other IDs the same way."
msgstr "Defina `PostId` e outros IDs da mesma forma."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Type caster"
msgstr "Type caster"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace App\\Shared\\Uuid;\n"
"\n"
"use Ramsey\\Uuid\\Uuid;\n"
"use ReflectionNamedType;\n"
"use ReflectionType;\n"
"use ReflectionUnionType;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\Result;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\TypeCastContext;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\TypeCasterInterface;\n"
"\n"
"use function count;\n"
"use function is_string;\n"
"use function is_subclass_of;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class UuidValueTypeCaster implements TypeCasterInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    public function cast(mixed $value, TypeCastContext $context): Result\n"
"    {\n"
"        $class = $this->findUuidValueClass($context->getReflectionType());\n"
"        if ($class === null) {\n"
"            return Result::fail();\n"
"        }\n"
"\n"
"        if ($value instanceof $class) {\n"
"            return Result::success($value);\n"
"        }\n"
"\n"
"        if (!is_string($value) || !Uuid::isValid($value)) {\n"
"            return Result::fail();\n"
"        }\n"
"\n"
"        return Result::success(new $class($value));\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    /**\n"
"     * Returns the `UuidValue` child class from the declared type, or `null` if there is none or there are several\n"
"     * of them, such as in `UserId|PostId`.\n"
"     *\n"
"     * @return class-string<UuidValue>|null\n"
"     */\n"
"    private function findUuidValueClass(?ReflectionType $type): ?string\n"
"    {\n"
"        $types = match (true) {\n"
"            $type instanceof ReflectionNamedType => [$type],\n"
"            $type instanceof ReflectionUnionType => $type->getTypes(),\n"
"            default => [],\n"
"        };\n"
"\n"
"        $classes = [];\n"
"        foreach ($types as $subType) {\n"
"            if (\n"
"                $subType instanceof ReflectionNamedType\n"
"                && !$subType->isBuiltin()\n"
"                && is_subclass_of($subType->getName(), UuidValue::class)\n"
"            ) {\n"
"                $classes[] = $subType->getName();\n"
"            }\n"
"        }\n"
"\n"
"        return count($classes) === 1 ? $classes[0] : null;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace App\\Shared\\Uuid;\n"
"\n"
"use Ramsey\\Uuid\\Uuid;\n"
"use ReflectionNamedType;\n"
"use ReflectionType;\n"
"use ReflectionUnionType;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\Result;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\TypeCastContext;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\TypeCaster\\TypeCasterInterface;\n"
"\n"
"use function count;\n"
"use function is_string;\n"
"use function is_subclass_of;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class UuidValueTypeCaster implements TypeCasterInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    public function cast(mixed $value, TypeCastContext $context): Result\n"
"    {\n"
"        $class = $this->findUuidValueClass($context->getReflectionType());\n"
"        if ($class === null) {\n"
"            return Result::fail();\n"
"        }\n"
"\n"
"        if ($value instanceof $class) {\n"
"            return Result::success($value);\n"
"        }\n"
"\n"
"        if (!is_string($value) || !Uuid::isValid($value)) {\n"
"            return Result::fail();\n"
"        }\n"
"\n"
"        return Result::success(new $class($value));\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    /**\n"
"     * Retorna a classe filha de `UuidValue` a partir do tipo declarado, ou `null` se não houver nenhuma ou houver várias\n"
"     * delas, como em `UserId|PostId`.\n"
"     *\n"
"     * @return class-string<UuidValue>|null\n"
"     */\n"
"    private function findUuidValueClass(?ReflectionType $type): ?string\n"
"    {\n"
"        $types = match (true) {\n"
"            $type instanceof ReflectionNamedType => [$type],\n"
"            $type instanceof ReflectionUnionType => $type->getTypes(),\n"
"            default => [],\n"
"        };\n"
"\n"
"        $classes = [];\n"
"        foreach ($types as $subType) {\n"
"            if (\n"
"                $subType instanceof ReflectionNamedType\n"
"                && !$subType->isBuiltin()\n"
"                && is_subclass_of($subType->getName(), UuidValue::class)\n"
"            ) {\n"
"                $classes[] = $subType->getName();\n"
"            }\n"
"        }\n"
"\n"
"        return count($classes) === 1 ? $classes[0] : null;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "The caster follows the [rules for writing a type caster](#anatomy-of-a-type-caster). It chooses the class to create from the declared type. All IDs share the same UUID format, so a string alone can't tell whether it's a user ID or a post ID. A single caster therefore serves all `UuidValue` child classes, and adding a new ID class doesn't require changes to the caster. For the same reason, the caster fails for a type with several ID classes, such as `UserId|PostId`. There's no way to choose the right one."
msgstr "O caster segue as [regras para escrever um type caster](#anatomia-de-um-type-caster). Ele escolhe a classe a ser criada a partir do tipo declarado. Todos os IDs compartilham o mesmo formato UUID, então uma string sozinha não diz se é um ID de usuário ou de post. Por isso, um único caster atende todas as classes filhas de `UuidValue`, e adicionar uma nova classe de ID não exige mudanças no caster. Pelo mesmo motivo, o caster falha para um tipo com várias classes de ID, como `UserId|PostId`. Não há como escolher a correta."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "Register `UuidValueTypeCaster` as shown in the [Registering a type caster](#registering-a-type-caster) section, including the [form model configuration](#registering-for-form-models) if you use Yii Form Model."
msgstr "Registre o `UuidValueTypeCaster` como mostrado na seção [Registrando um type caster](#registrando-um-type-caster), incluindo a [configuração para form models](#registrando-para-form-models) se você usa o Yii Form Model."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using the value objects"
msgstr "Usando os value objects"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "Now any class that's populated by the hydrator can declare ID value objects directly."
msgstr "Agora qualquer classe preenchida pelo hydrator pode declarar value objects de ID diretamente."

#. type: Title ####
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hydrator"
msgstr "Hydrator"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "The same string becomes a different value object depending on the type of the property:"
msgstr "A mesma string se torna um value object diferente dependendo do tipo da propriedade:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use App\\Post\\PostId;\n"
"use App\\User\\UserId;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\HydratorInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final class CommentFilter\n"
"{\n"
"    public ?UserId $authorId = null;\n"
"    public ?PostId $postId = null;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"/** @var HydratorInterface $hydrator */\n"
"$filter = $hydrator->create(CommentFilter::class, [\n"
"    'authorId' => '0192f2a4-7a4b-7c3e-9a1b-3f5c8d2e6a10',\n"
"    'postId' => '0192f2a4-7a4b-7c3e-9a1b-3f5c8d2e6a10',\n"
"]);\n"
"\n"
"// $filter->authorId is UserId, $filter->postId is PostId.\n"
"// $filter->authorId->equals($filter->postId) returns false.\n"
msgstr ""
"use App\\Post\\PostId;\n"
"use App\\User\\UserId;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Hydrator\\HydratorInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final class CommentFilter\n"
"{\n"
"    public ?UserId $authorId = null;\n"
"    public ?PostId $postId = null;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"/** @var HydratorInterface $hydrator */\n"
"$filter = $hydrator->create(CommentFilter::class, [\n"
"    'authorId' => '0192f2a4-7a4b-7c3e-9a1b-3f5c8d2e6a10',\n"
"    'postId' => '0192f2a4-7a4b-7c3e-9a1b-3f5c8d2e6a10',\n"
"]);\n"
"\n"
"// $filter->authorId é UserId, $filter->postId é PostId.\n"
"// $filter->authorId->equals($filter->postId) retorna false.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Request input"
msgstr "Entrada da requisição"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "The [Yii Input HTTP](https://github.com/yiisoft/input-http) package uses the hydrator to fill request input objects, so the same type caster works for query parameters, request body, and route arguments. The `RouteArgument` attribute comes from [Yii Router](https://github.com/yiisoft/router). Extend `AbstractInput` to get the input validated after hydration:"
msgstr "O pacote [Yii Input HTTP](https://github.com/yiisoft/input-http) usa o hydrator para preencher objetos de entrada da requisição, então o mesmo type caster funciona para parâmetros da query string, corpo da requisição e argumentos da rota. O atributo `RouteArgument` vem do [Yii Router](https://github.com/yiisoft/router). Estenda `AbstractInput` para que a entrada seja validada após a hidratação:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace App\\Post\\Update;\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Post\\PostId;\n"
"use App\\User\\UserId;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Input\\Http\\AbstractInput;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Input\\Http\\Attribute\\Parameter\\Body;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\HydratorAttribute\\RouteArgument;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Validator\\Rule\\Required;\n"
"\n"
"final class UpdatePostInput extends AbstractInput\n"
"{\n"
"    #[RouteArgument('id')]\n"
"    #[Required]\n"
"    public ?PostId $id = null;\n"
"\n"
"    #[Body('author_id')]\n"
"    #[Required]\n"
"    public ?UserId $authorId = null;\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace App\\Post\\Update;\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Post\\PostId;\n"
"use App\\User\\UserId;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Input\\Http\\AbstractInput;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Input\\Http\\Attribute\\Parameter\\Body;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\HydratorAttribute\\RouteArgument;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Validator\\Rule\\Required;\n"
"\n"
"final class UpdatePostInput extends AbstractInput\n"
"{\n"
"    #[RouteArgument('id')]\n"
"    #[Required]\n"
"    public ?PostId $id = null;\n"
"\n"
"    #[Body('author_id')]\n"
"    #[Required]\n"
"    public ?UserId $authorId = null;\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class Action\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __invoke(UpdatePostInput $input): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        if (!$input->getValidationResult()->isValid()) {\n"
"            // Return an error response.\n"
"        }\n"
"\n"
"        // $input->id is PostId, $input->authorId is UserId.\n"
"        // ...\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class Action\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __invoke(UpdatePostInput $input): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        if (!$input->getValidationResult()->isValid()) {\n"
"            // Retorne uma resposta de erro.\n"
"        }\n"
"\n"
"        // $input->id é PostId, $input->authorId é UserId.\n"
"        // ...\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Title ####
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Form model"
msgstr "Form model"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "`FormHydrator` from [Yii Form Model](https://github.com/yiisoft/form-model) populates form models. Once you [register the caster for form models](#registering-for-form-models), you can declare form properties as value objects too:"
msgstr "O `FormHydrator` do [Yii Form Model](https://github.com/yiisoft/form-model) preenche form models. Depois que você [registra o caster para form models](#registrando-para-form-models), também pode declarar propriedades de formulário como value objects:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace App\\Post\\Create;\n"
"\n"
"use App\\User\\UserId;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\FormModel\\FormModel;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Validator\\Rule\\Length;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Validator\\Rule\\Required;\n"
"\n"
"final class CreatePostForm extends FormModel\n"
"{\n"
"    #[Required]\n"
"    #[Length(min: 2)]\n"
"    public string $title = '';\n"
"\n"
"    #[Required]\n"
"    public ?UserId $authorId = null;\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace App\\Post\\Create;\n"
"\n"
"use App\\User\\UserId;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\FormModel\\FormModel;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Validator\\Rule\\Length;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Validator\\Rule\\Required;\n"
"\n"
"final class CreatePostForm extends FormModel\n"
"{\n"
"    #[Required]\n"
"    #[Length(min: 2)]\n"
"    public string $title = '';\n"
"\n"
"    #[Required]\n"
"    public ?UserId $authorId = null;\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ServerRequestInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\FormModel\\FormHydrator;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class Action\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private FormHydrator $formHydrator,\n"
"    ) {}\n"
"\n"
"    public function __invoke(ServerRequestInterface $request): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        $form = new CreatePostForm();\n"
"\n"
"        if ($this->formHydrator->populateFromPostAndValidate($form, $request)) {\n"
"            // $form->authorId is UserId.\n"
"            // ...\n"
"        }\n"
"\n"
"        // ...\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ServerRequestInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\FormModel\\FormHydrator;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class Action\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private FormHydrator $formHydrator,\n"
"    ) {}\n"
"\n"
"    public function __invoke(ServerRequestInterface $request): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        $form = new CreatePostForm();\n"
"\n"
"        if ($this->formHydrator->populateFromPostAndValidate($form, $request)) {\n"
"            // $form->authorId é UserId.\n"
"            // ...\n"
"        }\n"
"\n"
"        // ...\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Null and invalid values"
msgstr "Valores nulos e inválidos"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "Here is what happens with a property declared as `?UserId` for different input values:"
msgstr "Veja o que acontece com uma propriedade declarada como `?UserId` para diferentes valores de entrada:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Input value                              | Handled by             | Property value                   |\n"
"|------------------------------------------|------------------------|----------------------------------|\n"
"| `'0192f2a4-7a4b-7c3e-9a1b-3f5c8d2e6a10'` | `UuidValueTypeCaster`  | `UserId` instance                |\n"
"| `null`                                   | `PhpNativeTypeCaster`  | `null`                           |\n"
"| `'not-a-uuid'`                           | none, all casters fail | default value, `null` in example |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Valor de entrada                         | Tratado por            | Valor da propriedade             |\n"
"|------------------------------------------|------------------------|----------------------------------|\n"
"| `'0192f2a4-7a4b-7c3e-9a1b-3f5c8d2e6a10'` | `UuidValueTypeCaster`  | instância de `UserId`            |\n"
"| `null`                                   | `PhpNativeTypeCaster`  | `null`                           |\n"
"| `'not-a-uuid'`                           | nenhum, todos falham   | valor padrão, `null` no exemplo  |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "The last row is the important one: the hydrator doesn't report the malformed value.  With the `Required` rule, validation catches it with the \"cannot be blank\" error.  See the [request input](#request-input) and [form model](#form-model) examples.  But if the property is optional, an invalid UUID is silently turned into `null` and is indistinguishable from a missing value. If that's not acceptable, keep the raw value for validation: declare the property as `string`, validate its format, and convert it to the value object after validation."
msgstr "A última linha é a importante: o hydrator não reporta o valor malformado.  Com a regra `Required`, a validação o detecta com o erro \"cannot be blank\".  Veja os exemplos de [entrada da requisição](#entrada-da-requisicao) e [form model](#form-model).  Mas, se a propriedade for opcional, um UUID inválido é silenciosamente transformado em `null` e fica indistinguível de um valor ausente. Se isso não for aceitável, mantenha o valor bruto para validação: declare a propriedade como `string`, valide seu formato e converta-a para o value object após a validação."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When to use a type caster"
msgstr "Quando usar um type caster"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "A type caster fits well when the conversion:"
msgstr "Um type caster é uma boa escolha quando a conversão:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "depends only on the value and the declared type."
msgstr "depende apenas do valor e do tipo declarado."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "is the same everywhere in the application."
msgstr "é a mesma em toda a aplicação."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "doesn't need I/O, such as database queries or HTTP calls."
msgstr "não precisa de I/O, como consultas ao banco de dados ou chamadas HTTP."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "Value objects for IDs, emails, and money amounts match all three. Keep the conversion in a dedicated mapper or a domain factory instead when it:"
msgstr "Value objects para IDs, e-mails e valores monetários atendem aos três critérios. Mantenha a conversão em um mapper dedicado ou em uma factory de domínio quando ela:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "needs a database lookup, for example, turning an ID into a loaded entity."
msgstr "precisa consultar o banco de dados, por exemplo, transformar um ID em uma entidade carregada."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "depends on context, such as the current user."
msgstr "depende de contexto, como o usuário atual."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "combines several input fields into one object."
msgstr "combina vários campos de entrada em um único objeto."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/cookbook/custom-hydrator-type-casters.md
msgid "differs between use cases."
msgstr "difere entre casos de uso."
